From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 22:26:20 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 2/5] HALL-1 candidate (OFF): open the nave, warm hearths and
 shrine, rug on the shrine cobbles

Main's F17-6 baseline at High maps 6.18 (approach-nave 6.43, nave-sides 6.19,
shrine 5.92); judges: near-field posts PRESENT, bare hall PARTIAL, cool-blue
shrine focal PARTIAL. Behind hall_1.enabled (false):
- remove the z=+/-6 nave posts, braces, ties and their two post lanterns;
- installed ranger_hearth with a lit camp flame on the west wall (replaces
  WallBenchL3) and on the Shrine Room north wall, stools and logs beside;
- the shrine altar halo warm gold instead of #4aa8ff; ShrineGlow 2.6 -> 1.5
  (the east plaster wall blew out);
- a woven rug (runner shader, new `rugs` list) over the Shrine Room cobbles;
- a dressed table in the east aisle where the post stood.
Great hall pieces take an optional ignite_energy (campfire glow on a flame
sculpt); hall_1.remove also matches unnamed rows by model path.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
